msgstr "(a)"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:254
msgid ""
"Pure-TypeScript wire-protocol drivers — no Rust, no native dep. Use Perry's "
"[`compilePackages`](../packages/porting.md) to compile the TS to native via "
"LLVM. Also run unmodified on Node.js / Bun. Independent semver."
msgstr ""
"Drivers de protocolo de red escritos en TypeScript puro — sin Rust, sin "
"dependencia nativa. Usa [`compilePackages`](../packages/porting.md) de Perry "
"para compilar el TS a nativo mediante LLVM. También funcionan sin "
"modificaciones en Node.js / Bun. Semver independiente."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:255
msgid "**External native binding**"
msgstr "**Binding nativo externo**"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:255
msgid "`bun add @perryts/tursodb`"
msgstr "`bun add @perryts/tursodb`"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:255
msgid ""
"Third-party Rust crate using `perry-ffi`, manifest at "
"`package.json::perry.nativeLibrary`. Today: `@perryts/tursodb`, `@perryts/"
"iroh`."
msgstr ""
"Crate Rust de terceros que usa `perry-ffi`, con manifiesto en "
"`package.json::perry.nativeLibrary`. Actualmente: `@perryts/tursodb`, "
"`@perryts/iroh`."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:257
msgid ""
"Resolution precedence (per layer (a) → (b) → (c) above): an installed "
"`@perryts/mysql` does **not** override `import 'mysql2'` because the package "
"names are different. If you `bun add @perryts/mysql` and also `import "
"'mysql2'` in the same program, both drivers ship in the binary — they're "
"independent. To opt out of the well-known `mysql2` shim, just don't import "
"`mysql2`."
msgstr ""
"Precedencia de resolución (por capa (a) → (b) → (c) anterior): un `@perryts/"
"mysql` instalado **no** anula `import 'mysql2'` porque los nombres de "
"paquete son diferentes. Si haces `bun add @perryts/mysql` y también usas "
"`import 'mysql2'` en el mismo programa, ambos drivers se incluyen en el "
"binario — son independientes. Para no usar el shim conocido de `mysql2`, "
"simplemente no importes `mysql2`."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:264
msgid "**When to pick which:**"
msgstr "**Cuándo elegir cuál:**"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:266
msgid ""
"**Well-known native (`mysql2` / `pg` / `mongodb`)** — current zero-install "
"compatibility path; its feature set tracks Perry's release cadence and it is "
"scheduled to yield to compiled package source."
msgstr ""
"**Nativo conocido (`mysql2` / `pg` / `mongodb`)** — ruta de compatibilidad "
"actual de ceroinstall; su función establece pistas de la cadencia de "
"lanzamiento de Perry y está programado para ceder a la fuente de paquetes "
"compilados."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:269
msgid ""
"**`@perryts/postgres` / `@perryts/mysql` / `@perryts/mongodb` / `@perryts/"
"redis`** — you want to read / fork / patch the driver in plain TypeScript; "
"you want the same code running on Node.js or Bun for fallback; you need a "
"feature ahead of Perry's next release."
msgstr ""
"**`@perryts/postgres` / `@perryts/mysql` / `@perryts/mongodb` / `@perryts/"
"redis`** — quieres leer / hacer fork / parchear el driver en TypeScript "
"plano; quieres que el mismo código funcione en Node.js o Bun como "
"alternativa; necesitas una característica antes del próximo release de Perry."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:273
msgid ""
"**External native binding** — you're wrapping a Rust crate that doesn't have "
"a JS-only equivalent (Tursodb's embedded SQLite- compatible engine, Iroh's "
"QUIC transport)."
msgstr ""
"**Binding nativo externo** — estás envolviendo un crate Rust que no tiene un "
"equivalente solo en JS (el motor SQLite embebido compatible de Tursodb, el "
"transporte QUIC de Iroh)."

