#: src/threading/spawn.md:236
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function spawnDeferred(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const params = { size: 8 }\n"
"\n"
"    // Start computation early, use result later\n"
"    const precomputed = spawn(() => {\n"
"        const table: number[] = []\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < params.size; i++) table.push(i * i)\n"
"        return table\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // ... do other setup work ...\n"
"\n"
"    // Result is ready (or we wait for it)\n"
"    const table = await precomputed\n"
"    console.log(`spawn-deferred len=${table.length} last=$"
"{table[table.length - 1]}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function spawnDeferred(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const params = { size: 8 }\n"
"\n"
"    // Start computation early, use result later\n"
"    const precomputed = spawn(() => {\n"
"        const table: number[] = []\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < params.size; i++) table.push(i * i)\n"
"        return table\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // ... do other setup work ...\n"
"\n"
"    // Result is ready (or we wait for it)\n"
"    const table = await precomputed\n"
"    console.log(`spawn-deferred len=${table.length} last=$"
"{table[table.length - 1]}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/overview.md:1
msgid "UI Overview"
msgstr "Descripción General de la UI"

#: src/ui/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry's `perry/ui` module lets you build native desktop and mobile apps with "
"declarative TypeScript. Your UI code compiles directly to platform-native "
"widgets — AppKit on macOS, UIKit on iOS, GTK4 on Linux, Win32 on Windows, "
"and DOM elements on the web."
msgstr ""
"El módulo `perry/ui` de Perry te permite crear aplicaciones de escritorio y "
"móviles nativas con TypeScript declarativo. El código de tu UI se compila "
"directamente en widgets nativos de la plataforma: AppKit en macOS, UIKit en "
"iOS, GTK4 en Linux, Win32 en Windows y elementos DOM en la web."

#: src/ui/overview.md:5 src/tui/overview.md:16 src/i18n/overview.md:27
#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:9
