#: src/ui/layout.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry provides layout containers that arrange child widgets using the "
"platform's native layout system. Every snippet below is excerpted from "
"[`docs/examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/"
"snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
"Perry proporciona contenedores de layout que organizan los widgets hijos "
"utilizando el sistema de layout nativo de la plataforma. Cada fragmento de "
"código a continuación está extraído de [`docs/examples/ui/layout/"
"snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts) — CI lo compila y "
"ejecuta en cada PR."

#: src/ui/layout.md:8
msgid ""
"Layout helpers are free functions: `widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, "
"`stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, "
"bottom,  right)`, etc. Stack constructors take a numeric spacing followed by "
"a child array; everything else (alignment, distribution, padding, sizing) is "
"applied post-construction via the free functions on the widget handle."
msgstr ""
"Los ayudantes de distribución son funciones gratuitas: "
"`widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, `stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, "
"`widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, bottom,  right)`, etc. Los constructores "
"de pilas toman un espaciado numérico seguido por un array hijo; todo lo "
"demás (alineación, distribución, relleno, dimensionamiento) se aplica "
"después de la construcción a través de las funciones gratuitas en el mango "
"del widget."

#: src/ui/layout.md:14 src/platforms/watchos.md:141 src/platforms/android.md:34
#: src/platforms/linux.md:48 src/widgets/components.md:40
msgid "VStack"
msgstr "VStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:16
msgid "Arranges children vertically (top to bottom)."
msgstr "Organiza los hijos verticalmente (de arriba a abajo)."

#: src/ui/layout.md:18
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:26
msgid ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — the first argument is the gap in points "
"between children."
msgstr ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — el primer argumento es el espacio en puntos "
"entre los hijos."

#: src/ui/layout.md:29 src/platforms/watchos.md:142 src/platforms/android.md:35
#: src/platforms/linux.md:49 src/widgets/components.md:49
msgid "HStack"
msgstr "HStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:31
msgid "Arranges children horizontally (left to right)."
msgstr "Organiza los hijos horizontalmente (de izquierda a derecha)."

#: src/ui/layout.md:33
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"OK\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"OK\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:41 src/platforms/watchos.md:143 src/platforms/android.md:36
#: src/platforms/linux.md:50 src/widgets/components.md:59
msgid "ZStack"
msgstr "ZStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:43
msgid ""
"Layers children on top of each other (back to front). `ZStack()` takes no "
"constructor children — populate it with `widgetAddChild`:"
msgstr ""
"Apila los hijos unos sobre otros (de atrás hacia adelante). `ZStack()` no "
"recibe hijos en el constructor — se puebla con `widgetAddChild`:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:46
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:52 src/platforms/macos.md:35 src/platforms/ios.md:61
#: src/platforms/tvos.md:60 src/platforms/watchos.md:149
#: src/platforms/android.md:37 src/platforms/windows.md:61
#: src/platforms/linux.md:51 src/testing/geisterhand.md:94
msgid "ScrollView"
msgstr "ScrollView"

#: src/ui/layout.md:54
msgid ""
"A scrollable container. Built empty, then filled via `scrollviewSetChild`:"
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor desplazable. Se crea vacío y luego se rellena mediante "
"`scrollviewSetChild`:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:56
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:63
msgid "LazyVStack"
msgstr "LazyVStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:65
msgid ""
"A vertically scrolling list that lazily renders items. More efficient than "
"`ScrollView` + `VStack` for thousands of rows — on macOS this is backed by "
"`NSTableView` so only rows in the visible rect are realized."
msgstr ""
"Una lista de desplazamiento vertical que renderiza los elementos de forma "
"diferida. Más eficiente que `ScrollView` + `VStack` para miles de filas — en "
"macOS está respaldado por `NSTableView`, por lo que solo se realizan las "
"filas dentro del rectángulo visible."

#: src/ui/layout.md:69
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:74
msgid ""
"When the underlying data changes, call `lazyvstackUpdate(handle, newCount)` "
"to refresh. Override the default 44pt row height with "
"`lazyvstackSetRowHeight`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando los datos subyacentes cambian, llama a `lazyvstackUpdate(handle, "
"newCount)` para actualizar. Reemplaza la altura de fila predeterminada de "
"44pt con `lazyvstackSetRowHeight`."

#: src/ui/layout.md:77
msgid "NavStack"
msgstr "NavStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:79
msgid ""
"A navigation container that supports push/pop navigation. Push a new view "
"with `navstackPush(stack, view, title)`; pop with `navstackPop(stack)`:"
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor de navegación que admite navegación push/pop. Inserta una "
"nueva vista con `navstackPush(stack, view, title)`; retrocede con "
"`navstackPop(stack)`:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:82
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:93 src/platforms/watchos.md:144
#: src/widgets/components.md:68 src/widgets/platforms.md:30
#: src/widgets/platforms.md:31
msgid "Spacer"
msgstr "Spacer"

#: src/ui/layout.md:95
msgid "A flexible space that expands to fill available room."
msgstr "Un espacio flexible que se expande para ocupar el espacio disponible."

#: src/ui/layout.md:97
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const toolbar = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Text(\"Left\"),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Text(\"Right\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const toolbar = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Text(\"Left\"),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Text(\"Right\"),\n"
"])\n"
