"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:80
msgid ""
"The `App()` call triggers `UIApplicationMain`, and your render function is "
"called via `PerryAppDelegate` once the app is ready. Perry-generated apps "
"use `UIWindowScene`, `PerrySceneDelegate`, and an "
"`UIApplicationSceneManifest`, which also satisfies the scene-based lifecycle "
"required for apps built with the iOS 27 SDK."
msgstr ""
"La llamada `App()` activa `UIApplicationMain`, y su función de renderizado "
"se llama a través de `PerryAppDelegate` una vez que la aplicación está "
"lista. Las aplicaciones generadas por Perry utilizan `UIWindowScene`, "
"`PerrySceneDelegate` y un `UIApplicationSceneManifest`, que también "
"satisface el ciclo de vida basado en la escena requerido para las "
"aplicaciones construidas con el iOS 27 SDK."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:82
msgid "Adaptive layouts"
msgstr "Diseños adaptativos"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:84
msgid ""
"Use `perry/ios` to inspect the active scene rather than branching on a "
"device model or physical screen size:"
msgstr ""
"Utilice `perry/ios` para inspeccionar la escena activa en lugar de ramificar "
"en un modelo de dispositivo o tamaño de pantalla física:"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:86
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  getLayoutEnvironment,\n"
"  onLayoutChange,\n"
"  offLayoutChange,\n"
"} from \"perry/ios\";\n"
"\n"
"const initial = getLayoutEnvironment();\n"
"console.log(initial.width, initial.horizontalSizeClass, "
"initial.windowMode);\n"
"\n"
"const subscription = onLayoutChange((layout) => {\n"
"  if (layout.horizontalSizeClass === \"compact\") {\n"
"    // Present a compact navigation treatment.\n"
"  }\n"
"  if (layout.isFourByThree || layout.windowMode === \"sideBySide\") {\n"
"    // Reflow content for 4:3 or iPad side-by-side multitasking.\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"  // These insets describe display cutouts, rounded corners, and any future\n"
"  // interrupted-display geometry exposed to the scene by UIKit.\n"
"  console.log(layout.safeAreaTop, layout.safeAreaRight);\n"
"});\n"
"\n"
"// When the observer is no longer needed:\n"
"offLayoutChange(subscription);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  getLayoutEnvironment,\n"
"  onLayoutChange,\n"
"  offLayoutChange,\n"
"} from \"perry/ios\";\n"
"\n"
"const initial = getLayoutEnvironment();\n"
"console.log(initial.width, initial.horizontalSizeClass, "
"initial.windowMode);\n"
"\n"
"const subscription = onLayoutChange((layout) => {\n"
"  if (layout.horizontalSizeClass === \"compact\") {\n"
"    // Present a compact navigation treatment.\n"
"  }\n"
"  if (layout.isFourByThree || layout.windowMode === \"sideBySide\") {\n"
"    // Reflow content for 4:3 or iPad side-by-side multitasking.\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"  // These insets describe display cutouts, rounded corners, and any future\n"
"  // interrupted-display geometry exposed to the scene by UIKit.\n"
"  console.log(layout.safeAreaTop, layout.safeAreaRight);\n"
"});\n"
"\n"
"// When the observer is no longer needed:\n"
"offLayoutChange(subscription);\n"
"```"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:113
msgid ""
"Snapshots contain the window dimensions and aspect ratio, display scale, "
"horizontal and vertical size classes, orientation, window mode, multitasking "
"and 4:3 flags, and all four safe-area insets. On iOS 27 they also contain "
"the effective scene's system-space frame, interactive-resize state, and "
"orientation-lock state. The callback fires once when a scene is available "
"and then after meaningful bounds, trait, safe-area, or effective-geometry "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Las instantáneas contienen las dimensiones de la ventana y la relación de "
"aspecto, la escala de visualización, las clases de tamaño horizontal y "
"vertical, la orientación, el modo de ventana, la multitarea y las banderas "
"4:3, y los cuatro conjuntos de áreas seguras. En iOS 27 también contienen el "
"marco de espacio-sistema de la escena efectiva, el estado de "
"redimensionamiento interactivo y el estado de bloqueo de orientación. El "
"callback se dispara una vez cuando una escena está disponible y luego "
"después de límites significativos, rasgo, área segura o cambios de geometría "
"efectiva."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:115
msgid ""
"UIKit does not expose a separate public hardware-model or hinge-state "
"property. Safe areas, effective scene geometry, and trait collections are "
"the supported adaptive signals, and they continue to work when one device "
"moves among full-screen, side-by-side, and freeform window modes. Perry's "
"`SplitView` and `FrameSplit` also cap their preferred sidebar at 45% of the "
"current scene width so the detail pane remains usable in narrow layouts."
msgstr ""
"UIKit no expone un modelo de hardware público separado o propiedad de "
"bisagras. Las zonas seguras, la geometría efectiva de la escena y las "
"colecciones de rasgos son las señales adaptativas soportadas, y siguen "
"funcionando cuando un dispositivo se mueve entre los modos de pantalla "
"completa, lado a lado y ventana de forma libre. Los `SplitView` y "
"`FrameSplit` de Perry también limitan su barra lateral preferida al 45% del "
"ancho de escena actual, por lo que el panel de detalle permanece utilizable "
"en diseños estrechos."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:117
msgid "Foundation Models"
msgstr "Modelos de la fundación"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:119
msgid ""
"The simple, unstructured Foundation Models flow is available through `perry/"
"ios`:"
msgstr ""
"El flujo simple y no estructurado de los modelos de la fundación está "
"disponible a través de `perry/ios`:"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:121
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  foundationModelAvailability,\n"
"  createLanguageModelSession,\n"
"  respond,\n"
"  destroyLanguageModelSession,\n"
"} from \"perry/ios\";\n"
"\n"
"if (foundationModelAvailability() === \"available\") {\n"
"  const session = createLanguageModelSession(\n"
"    \"Answer in one short, factual sentence.\",\n"
"  );\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const answer = await respond(session, \"Why is the sky blue?\");\n"
"    console.log(answer);\n"
"  } finally {\n"
"    destroyLanguageModelSession(session);\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  foundationModelAvailability,\n"
"  createLanguageModelSession,\n"
"  respond,\n"
"  destroyLanguageModelSession,\n"
"} from \"perry/ios\";\n"
"\n"
"if (foundationModelAvailability() === \"available\") {\n"
"  const session = createLanguageModelSession(\n"
"    \"Answer in one short, factual sentence.\",\n"
"  );\n"
"  try {\n"
"    const answer = await respond(session, \"Why is the sky blue?\");\n"
"    console.log(answer);\n"
"  } finally {\n"
"    destroyLanguageModelSession(session);\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:142
msgid ""
"The bridge uses Apple's default `LanguageModelSession`, preserves "
"conversational context while a session handle is reused, and rejects the "
"returned promise when generation fails. Check availability first: "
"unsupported OS versions and unavailable Apple Intelligence configurations "
"are reported without loading the framework. This surface intentionally "
"returns plain strings; structured `@Generable` responses are outside the "
"current API."
msgstr ""
"El puente utiliza el `LanguageModelSession` predeterminado de Apple, "
"preserva el contexto conversacional mientras se reutiliza un mango de sesión "
"y rechaza la promesa devuelta cuando la generación falla. Compruebe la "
"disponibilidad primero: las versiones del sistema operativo no soportadas y "
"las configuraciones de Apple Intelligence no disponibles se reportan sin "
"cargar el framework. Esta superficie devuelve intencionalmente cadenas "
"simples; las respuestas estructuradas `@Generable` están fuera de la API "
"actual."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:144
msgid ""
"Building a source file that imports `perry/ios` requires an Xcode SDK "
"containing `FoundationModels.framework` (Xcode 26 or later). The framework "
"is weak-linked, so the normal iOS 17 deployment target remains valid."
msgstr ""
"La construcción de un archivo fuente que importa `perry/ios` requiere un SDK "
"Xcode que contenga `FoundationModels.framework` (Xcode 26 o posterior). El "
"marco es débil, por lo que el objetivo normal de despliegue iOS 17 sigue "
"siendo válido."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:146
msgid "Now Playing on iOS 27"
msgstr "Ahora jugando en iOS 27"

#: src/platforms/ios.md:148
msgid ""
"`perry/media.setNowPlaying(...)` is the public Perry API for Lock Screen, "
"Control Center, Dynamic Island, CarPlay, artwork, playback progress, and "
"play/pause/stop/seek commands. When an Xcode 27 SDK containing "
"`NowPlaying.framework` is installed, Perry automatically compiles an "
"observable `MediaSession` bridge and publishes each player through the new "
"framework. Builds made with older SDKs, and devices before iOS 27, retain "
"the existing `MPNowPlayingInfoCenter` / `MPRemoteCommandCenter` "
"compatibility path. Perry never activates both paths for one local session."
msgstr ""
"`perry/media.setNowPlaying(...)` es la API pública de Perry para pantalla de "
"bloqueo, centro de control, Dynamic Island, CarPlay, arte, progreso de la "
"reproducción y comandos play/pause/stop/seek. Cuando se instala un Xcode 27 "
"SDK que contiene `NowPlaying.framework`, Perry compila automáticamente un "
"puente `MediaSession` observable y publica cada reproductor a través del "
"nuevo marco. Construye con SDKs antiguos y dispositivos antes de iOS 27, "
"conserva la ruta de compatibilidad existente de `MPNowPlayingInfoCenter` / "
"`MPRemoteCommandCenter`. Perry nunca activa ambas rutas para una sesión "
"local."

#: src/platforms/ios.md:150
msgid ""
"The iOS 27 SDK is beta software until Apple's GM release. This support does "
"not change Perry's SDK build markers or version; distribution metadata "
"should only be updated once the GM toolchain can submit to App Store Connect."
msgstr ""
"El iOS 27 SDK es un software beta hasta la versión GM de Apple. Este soporte "
"no cambia los marcadores de compilación SDK de Perry o la versión; los "
"metadatos de distribución sólo deben actualizarse una vez que la cadena de "
"herramientas GM pueda enviar a App Store Connect."

