#: src/platforms/wearos.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry can compile TypeScript apps for Wear OS watches and the Wear OS "
"emulator."
msgstr ""
"Perry puede compilar aplicaciones TypeScript para relojes Wear OS y el "
"emulador Wear OS."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:5
msgid ""
"Wear OS **is Android on a watch**, so Perry reuses the exact same backend as "
"the [Android](android.md) target: your `perry/ui` tree lowers through `perry-"
"ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / `LinearLayout` / `Button` / …), and the "
"compiled `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` is identical to a phone build. `perry "
"run wearos` then packages it with a **watch form-factor overlay** — the "
"`android.hardware.type.watch` feature, the standalone meta-data, and the "
"`androidx.wear` support library — and installs it over `adb` like any other "
"APK."
msgstr ""
"Wear OS **es Android en un reloj**, por lo que Perry reutiliza exactamente "
"el mismo motor que el objetivo [Android](android.md): su árbol `perry/ui` "
"baja a través de `perry-ui-android` (JNI → `TextView` / `LinearLayout` / "
"`Button` / ...), y la compilación `aarch64-linux-android` `.so` es idéntica "
"a una compilación de teléfonos. `perry run wearos` entonces lo empaqueta con "
"un **Ver sobreimpresión del factor de forma** — la función "
"`android.hardware.type.watch`, los metadatos independientes y la biblioteca "
"de soporte `androidx.wear` — y la instala a través de `adb` como cualquier "
"otro APK."

#: src/platforms/wearos.md:13
msgid ""
"This page is about **full Wear OS apps**. For glanceable Wear OS **Tiles** "
"(the swipe-left surfaces, built from `Widget({...})` declarations), see "
"[Wear OS Tiles](../widgets/wearos.md)."
msgstr ""
"Esta página es sobre **Aplicaciones Wear OS completas**. Para Wear OS "
"**Azulejos** (las superficies deslizadoras hacia la izquierda, construidas "
"con declaraciones `Widget({...})`), véase [Wear OS Azulejos](../widgets/"
"wearos.md)."

