"**hono** — runtime-agnostic web framework. `app.fetch` works end-to-end via "
"`compilePackages`, and long-lived native servers can adapt it through "
"`node:http` or `@perryts/hono-server`. See [HTTP & Networking → Hono]"
"(http.md#hono); the old link gap was closed in [\\#589](https://github.com/"
"PerryTS/perry/issues/589)."
msgstr ""
"**hono** — marco web agnóstico en tiempo de ejecución. `app.fetch` funciona "
"de extremo a extremo a través de `compilePackages`, y los servidores nativos "
"de larga vida pueden adaptarlo a través de `node:http` o `@perryts/hono-"
"server`. Ver [HTTP & Networking → Hono](http.md#hono); el antiguo hueco de "
"enlace fue cerrado en [\\#589](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/589)."

