#: src/i18n/overview.md:1
msgid "Internationalization (i18n)"
msgstr "Internacionalización (i18n)"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry's i18n system lets you write natural English strings and have them "
"automatically translated at compile time. Zero ceremony, near-zero runtime "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"El sistema i18n de Perry te permite escribir cadenas en inglés natural y "
"hacer que se traduzcan automáticamente en tiempo de compilación. Sin "
"ceremonia, con un costo de runtime casi nulo."

#: src/i18n/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// String literals in UI component calls are automatically localizable "
"keys.\n"
"// (Conceptually the docs write `Button(\"Next\")` / `Text(\"Hello, {name}!"
"\", ...)`\n"
"// from \"perry/ui\"; we exercise the runtime API that backs them — t() — "
"here.)\n"
"const next = t(\"Next\")                                  // Automatically "
"localized\n"
"const hello = t(\"Hello, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })    // With "
"interpolation\n"
"console.log(next, hello)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// String literals in UI component calls are automatically localizable "
"keys.\n"
"// (Conceptually the docs write `Button(\"Next\")` / `Text(\"Hello, {name}!"
"\", ...)`\n"
"// from \"perry/ui\"; we exercise the runtime API that backs them — t() — "
"here.)\n"
"const next = t(\"Next\")                                  // Automatically "
"localized\n"
"const hello = t(\"Hello, {name}!\", { name: \"Alice\" })    // With "
"interpolation\n"
"console.log(next, hello)\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:14
msgid ""
"The same key-resolution and interpolation runs through the explicit `t()` "
"API for non-UI strings:"
msgstr ""
"La misma resolución de claves e interpolación se ejecuta a través de la API "
"explícita `t()` para cadenas que no son de UI:"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { t, Currency, Percent, ShortDate, LongDate, FormatNumber, "
"FormatTime, Raw } from \"perry/i18n\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"import { t, Currency, Percent, ShortDate, LongDate, FormatNumber, "
"FormatTime, Raw } from \"perry/i18n\"\n"
"```"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:20
msgid "Design Principles"
msgstr "Principios de diseño"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:22
msgid ""
"**Zero ceremony**: String literals in UI components are automatically "
"localizable keys"
msgstr ""
"**Sin ceremonia**: Los literales de cadena en los componentes de UI son "
"automáticamente claves localizables"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:23
msgid ""
"**Compile-time diagnostics**: Missing and unused translation keys are "
"reported as warnings during build (missing keys fall back to the default "
"locale's text)"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnóstico a tiempo de compilación**: Las claves de traducción que faltan "
"y no se usan se informan como advertencias durante la compilación (las "
"claves que faltan caen de nuevo al texto predeterminado de la localización)"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:24
msgid ""
"**Embedded string table**: All translations baked into the binary as a flat "
"2D table. Near-zero runtime lookup cost"
msgstr ""
"**Tabla de cadenas embebida**: Todas las traducciones se integran en el "
"binario como una tabla 2D plana. Costo de búsqueda en runtime casi nulo"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:25
msgid ""
"**Native locale detection**: POSIX locale environment variables first "
"(`LANGUAGE`, `LC_ALL`, `LC_MESSAGES`, `LANG`), then platform OS APIs — so "
"CLI binaries respect the environment and GUI apps (which carry no locale env "
"vars) use the OS setting"
msgstr ""
"**Detección de localización nativa**: Primero las variables de entorno local "
"de POSIX (`LANGUAGE`, `LC_ALL`, `LC_MESSAGES`, `LANG`), luego las API de OS "
"de plataforma — así que los binarios CLI respetan el entorno y las "
"aplicaciones de interfaz gráfica (que no tienen env vars de localización) "
"utilizan la configuración de sistema operativo"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:29
msgid "1. Add i18n config to perry.toml"
msgstr "1. Añadir la configuración de i18n a perry.toml"

#: src/i18n/overview.md:31
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[i18n]\n"
"locales = [\"en\", \"de\"]\n"
"default_locale = \"en\"\n"
"```"

