#: src/system/other.md:64
msgid ""
"`getDeviceIdiom()` returns the broad form factor as a string: `\"phone\"` or "
"`\"pad\"` on iOS (and `\"phone\"` on Android), `\"mac\"` on macOS, `\"tv\"` "
"on tvOS, `\"watch\"` on watchOS, `\"vision\"` on visionOS, and `\"desktop\"` "
"on Windows and Linux. `getDeviceModel()` returns the platform-specific model "
"identifier (`\"iPhone15,2\"`, `\"MacBookPro18,3\"`, etc. — on macOS this is "
"sysctl `hw.model`)."
msgstr ""
"`getDeviceIdiom()` devuelve el factor de forma amplia como cadena: "
"`\"phone\"` o `\"pad\"` en iOS (y `\"phone\"` en Android), `\"mac\"` en "
"macOS, `\"tv\"` en tvOS, `\"watch\"` en watchOS, `\"vision\"` en visionOS, y "
"`\"desktop\"` en Windows y Linux. `getDeviceModel()` devuelve el "
"identificador de modelo específico de la plataforma (`\"iPhone15,2\"`, "
"`\"MacBookPro18,3\"`, etc. — en macOS esto es sysctl `hw.model`)."

