#: src/testing/test-registration.md:20
msgid ""
"A dark test is invisible in exactly the way that matters. The PR is green. "
"The reviewer sees a witness in the diff and a passing CI run next to it and "
"reads the two together as \"covered\". Nothing says otherwise, because "
"nothing ran."
msgstr ""
"Una prueba oscura es invisible exactamente en la forma en que importa. El PR "
"es verde. El revisor ve a un testigo en el diff y un CI que pasa a su lado y "
"lee a los dos juntos como \"cubiertos\". Nada dice lo contrario, porque nada "
"corrió."

#: src/testing/test-registration.md:24
msgid ""
"It happened four times against `test-parity/gc_repsel_corpus.txt` alone:"
msgstr "Sucedió cuatro veces contra `test-parity/gc_repsel_corpus.txt` solo:"

