msgid ""
"Some legitimate crates need network during `build.rs` (e.g. fetching "
"prebuilt artifacts from a CDN). Opt them out per-package in the **host** "
"`package.json`:"
msgstr ""
"Algunos crates legítimos necesitan red durante `build.rs` (p. ej., para "
"obtener artefactos precompilados desde una CDN). Exclúyelos individualmente "
"por paquete en el `package.json` del **host**:"

#: src/cli/sandbox-buildrs.md:68
