"and prevents its finalizer from running. `napi_add_finalizer` may add "
"multiple independent records. When it returns a `napi_ref`, that record also "
"identifies the finalizer. Deleting that reference before collection removes "
"the host's tracking record, so the callback may never run; deleting it from "
"inside the already-queued callback only releases the reference."
msgstr ""
"`napi_wrap` instala como máximo un registro de envoltura por objeto. "
