#~ "metadata facilities (`Reflect.metadata`, `Symbol`\\-keyed metadata, "
#~ "`emitDecoratorMetadata` type capture) that Angular / NestJS / TypeORM DI "
#~ "containers rely on. See [Decorators](decorators.md) for the full stance "
#~ "and a worked migration recipe."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Perry analiza la sintaxis de decoradores y admite transformaciones solo "
